Description: pvr: advertise timestamps
 With a kernel that reports firmware job timestamps (winsys feature
 supports_job_timestamps): timestampValidBits 64 for the queue family,
 timestampPeriod 1 (the firmware writes ns) and timestampComputeAndGraphics.
 Without it, as before, timestampValidBits 0. zink takes timestampValidBits of the
 graphics queue family for the gallium caps query_timestamp and
 query_time_elapsed (zink_screen.c), which give GL_ARB_timer_query.
 .
 Only for this downstream stack; not intended for upstream submission.
